{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0433_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7761735cf794b184eb77a05897c0cfacc8721b6449702286e11bde21c5b377cb", "ja": "（今日は、グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。\nパジャマを着た環の撮影は順調に進んでいる）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄写真杂志《アイグラ！！》的日子。\n穿着睡衣的环，拍摄进展得很顺利。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0433_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "1bd1d5346f4dec07f3cc7f14840d4f1a8797a93a9f35054cbeec4c8d44a2064a", "ja": "おやぶーん、休憩だって！\nねぇねぇ、たまき、ちゃんとできてた？", "zh": "大将，要休息啦！\n呐呐，环刚才表现得还不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0433_1002_p", "source_sha256": "be38bc67c8941b14ff25719563f2b12b47c0df0f72444a74aa24306c53fd108f", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだよ。この調子なら時間前に終わるし、\n撮影後のご褒美も考えなきゃいけないな。", "zh": "啊，做得非常好。照这个进度，能在规定时间前结束，\n也得想想拍摄结束后的奖励了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0433_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "45fabc136fcd25341e0717be82757a7534678a586eb83a5c578953e56fa42e25", "ja": "ごほうび！？　わーい！\nたまき、おやぶんとまくら投げした～い！", "zh": "奖励！？好耶！\n环，想和老大一起玩枕头大战～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0433_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3d85df5f602ad8c4850464f019becb5a150a6ffb21df0f054c3b84ca8bf6dda1", "ja": "枕投げ？", "zh": "扔枕头？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0433_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "021d0ef1c622ffc84594a5aefee7623b508df3f98d55a7f309f62b76caaca722", "ja": "うん！　みんなでまくらを投げっこするの！\n劇場のみんなとやった時、すっごく楽しかったんだ～！", "zh": "嗯！大家一起互相扔枕头！\n之前和剧场的大家一起玩的时候，特别开心～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0433_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "b3abe2847f0bf0ef5fcb2d639590b50205b8ad115020c17697594ffbe31bb007", "ja": "当たっても痛くないから平気だぞ！\nねぇねぇおやぶん、やろうよ～！", "zh": "砸到了也不会痛，所以没事的！\n呐呐老大，一起来玩嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0433_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d25e054a47dd1cae80a7ce9460c1a06061a44b1c1aeb714770675f9c1d8e81c1", "ja": "枕投げか……。やりたいところだけど、\nさすがにセットを使って遊ぶわけにはな……。", "zh": "枕头大战啊……虽然很想玩，\n但总不能真的拿布景来玩吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0433_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "7c5f769e147f659c4011fafbe1779de3081bc613df38909e205b48b1e56a665e", "ja": "えー……。\nたまき、お仕事とレッスン頑張るぞ！", "zh": "诶……。\n环，接下来也要努力工作和上课！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0433_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "d05b385989b148b4eda7ffe08f7183cff7c828de59ec5654a8a3d737e149bdbb", "ja": "このあとも、いっぱいい～っぱいかわいい写真\n撮ってもらうから～！　お～ね～が～い～！", "zh": "接下来也要拍好多好多可爱的照片～！拜托啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0433_1010_p", "source_sha256": "60da9eb6588efb3f8231a879335dc77f6709a2d8a1e3a31100e07a43443d7744", "ja": "う～ん、そうだな……まてよ？\nその手があったか！", "zh": "嗯～，这么说来……等等？\n原来还有这个办法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0433_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "88470c578fa3693d925ae5ae75cbe638ab72474b21345609628a868da6c43fdd", "ja": "なになに～！？", "zh": "什么什么～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0433_1012_p", "source_sha256": "bbe7389774ace1c4d3e3e037963f1eb9755962253ef78c9c42115bf0e412e18a", "ja": "枕投げと撮影を合体させよう！\n環らしい元気で可愛いところが撮れると思う！", "zh": "把枕头大战和拍摄结合起来吧！\n我觉得这样能拍到符合小环风格的活泼可爱一面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0433_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "5ed9fa7d6755477422350b8dc8e80eadbd88a9e5edd86396d5cb4231f712929c", "ja": "おお～！　……んーと\nおやぶんとまくら投げしていいってこと？", "zh": "哦哦～！……嗯——也就是说，可以和老大打枕头仗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0433_1014_p", "source_sha256": "88fc05c9f5d85abbe35b94e5deeac62044d1124c35cbddd318e97f803e55d36f", "ja": "ああ！　その代わり……\n環はいい笑顔が撮れるように、思いきり楽しむこと！", "zh": "啊！不过作为交换……环要尽情玩个痛快，这样才能拍到灿烂的笑容！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0433_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "1b9f0b4bbface722b02563e6ac7e6cb8fbeaf6e738fb4f5d14cb68aa0c504962", "ja": "……！　うん！！　たまき、全力でまくら投げする！\nくふふ、必殺技も考えよーっと！", "zh": "……！　嗯！！　环会全力玩枕头大战的！\n嘿嘿，环也要想个必杀技～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0433_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "0047c3b88ddc4795335e06079161d389b7bb213cf72bc81450dadab4d13d619f", "ja": "こんなに楽しいお仕事なら、たまき毎日でもいいぞ～！\nねえ、おやぶん！　早くまくら投げしよ～！", "zh": "如果是这么开心的工作，环每天都来做也没问题哦～！\n对了，老大！快点来打枕头大战吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
